			"Message": "style(Mountain): Apply consistent formatting across Mountain codebase\n\nStandardize whitespace and formatting across 300+ files in Mountain's source tree:\n\n- Normalize import organization: add blank lines after `use` declarations and before struct/impl blocks across DTOs, state modules, command handlers, and provider implementations\n- Standardize dev_log! macro invocations: consistent argument alignment and line breaks\n- Fix Binary/README.md: replace raw em-space with HTML entity `&#x2001;` for reliable rendering\n- Add missing newlines at end of files where absent\n- Introduce domain dispatchers in `IPC/WindServiceHandlers/Dispatcher/` for configuration, encryption, extensions, filesystem, git, IPC status, keybindings, language features, lifecycle, logging, menubar, model, navigation, native host, notifications, output, process, progress, quick input, search, sky, storage, terminal, text files, themes, tree views, updates, URLs, working copy, and workspace commands\n- Condense single-statement methods to single-line format where appropriate\n- Normalize lock acquisition patterns and guard binding across state modules\n\nNo functional changes — purely mechanical formatting cleanup for consistency across Mountain's application state, IPC layer, command registry, provider traits, and service handlers.",
